03:05:23,230 --> 03:05:24,970
I'm doing so much more damage.

3010
03:05:26,110 --> 03:05:28,710
It may not look like it to you, but I can feel it, trust me.

3011
03:05:30,050 --> 03:05:32,470
I know how much I do to these guys normally.

3012
03:05:32,770 --> 03:05:33,890
Now they just insta-die.

3013
03:05:36,150 --> 03:05:38,450
I love the effect of the black hole on the spells.

3014
03:05:51,350 --> 03:05:53,930
I remember, in the beginning of this game,

3015
03:05:58,210 --> 03:05:59,710
thinking, oh, there's no way to heal here.

3016
03:05:59,790 --> 03:06:01,890
This is like, oh, if you take damage, that's it, you know?

3017
03:06:02,750 --> 03:06:04,310
I mean, other than going to the holy mountain.

3018
03:06:05,770 --> 03:06:07,370
Oh, how wrong I was.

3019
03:06:12,150 --> 03:06:12,910
Okay, we're back.

3020
03:06:13,810 --> 03:06:15,930
But now, I guess I don't need to grab that wand anymore.

3021
03:06:16,150 --> 03:06:17,950
That wand is useless to me right now.

3022
03:06:18,490 --> 03:06:19,670
I don't fucking need it anymore.

3023
03:06:20,590 --> 03:06:22,590
But, I would like a teleport.

3024
03:06:23,770 --> 03:06:24,490
The big one we need.

3025
03:06:25,450 --> 03:06:26,010
The teleport.

3026
03:06:26,890 --> 03:06:27,590
Let's find one.

3027
03:06:30,030 --> 03:06:32,510
And then it's time to solve some goddamn mysteries in this world.

3028
03:06:38,680 --> 03:06:39,040
Whoa.

3029
03:06:40,660 --> 03:06:41,840
And we should get high as well.

3030
03:06:42,460 --> 03:06:42,900
Or should we?

3031
03:06:43,120 --> 03:06:44,460
I feel like we should not risk anything right now.

3032
03:06:45,040 --> 03:06:45,400
No.

3033
03:06:46,000 --> 03:06:46,680
No, no, no, no.

3034
03:06:47,440 --> 03:06:48,920
I just really want to.

3035
03:06:51,500 --> 03:06:52,300
Hehe, heal me up!

3036
03:07:00,900 --> 03:07:01,500
Piercing shot!

3037
03:07:03,000 --> 03:07:04,100
I guess I don't need it anymore.

3038
03:07:05,240 --> 03:07:07,600
Also reduces damage by 15.

3039
03:07:10,020 --> 03:07:10,280
Wait.

3040
03:07:14,570 --> 03:07:15,470
No, I do need this.

3041
03:07:16,830 --> 03:07:20,910
This would make... No, I don't need it because I have improved healing now.

3042
03:07:21,070 --> 03:07:21,170
Fuck.

3043
03:07:21,850 --> 03:07:24,650
But I guess I'll take it anyway, because I didn't have another wand.

3044
03:07:25,990 --> 03:07:29,630
I was still in the state of mind where I had the healing bolt wand.

3045
03:07:34,270 --> 03:07:34,930
What's that?

3046
03:07:35,570 --> 03:07:36,390
Mystery fungus.

3047
03:07:37,450 --> 03:07:41,030
Wait, the blue sand is turning into mystery fungus.

3048
03:07:42,630 --> 03:07:43,490
Eat it.

3049
03:07:44,390 --> 03:07:45,570
Okay, fuck it, we're getting high.

3050
03:07:45,690 --> 03:07:47,390
I'm too mis... I'm too mystified.

3051
03:07:48,150 --> 03:07:49,530
We gotta get high on the mystery fungus.

3052
03:07:51,690 --> 03:07:53,590
How can you not do that, right?

3053
03:07:55,690 --> 03:07:56,430
Nothing happens.

3054
03:08:00,390 --> 03:08:00,810
Okay.

3055
03:08:01,810 --> 03:08:04,290
Why don't I get the screen effect at all either?

3056
03:08:04,470 --> 03:08:05,030
It's so weird.

3057
03:08:05,030 --> 03:08:11,370
Whenever I have the balls to actually get high, the game won't let me for some reason.

3058
03:08:13,190 --> 03:08:14,310
It's very interesting.

3059
03:08:21,410 --> 03:08:21,490
Damn.

3060
03:08:24,150 --> 03:08:25,430
I'll take it.

3061
03:08:33,360 --> 03:08:34,380
Holy shit.

3062
03:08:36,100 --> 03:08:38,160
There's all kinds of shit on this one.

3063
03:08:38,960 --> 03:08:39,220
Nope.

3064
03:08:42,520 --> 03:08:43,340
I reject.

3065
03:08:44,760 --> 03:08:48,680
Which feels insane to me, but you know.

3066
03:08:55,410 --> 03:08:59,770
The old black hole is actually kind of nuts for crowd-controlling enemies.

3067
03:09:01,770 --> 03:09:02,470
Like, look at this.

3068
03:09:03,810 --> 03:09:05,310
Oh wait, it's not getting sucked up in it?

3069
03:09:05,550 --> 03:09:06,190
I thought it was.

3070
03:09:07,350 --> 03:09:07,430
Look.

3071
03:09:10,580 --> 03:09:11,620
It's cool though.

3072
03:09:21,100 --> 03:09:23,120
This is too much fun.

3073
03:09:29,600 --> 03:09:30,700
Reduce re... Oh, this is big.

3074
03:09:31,240 --> 03:09:31,500
Take it.

3075
03:09:37,730 --> 03:09:38,170
Homing.

3076
03:09:38,930 --> 03:09:38,930
Ooh.

3077
03:09:40,970 --> 03:09:42,670
We could make a rock wand.

3078
03:09:44,390 --> 03:09:46,070
Now that we have infinite rocks.

3079
03:09:49,570 --> 03:09:50,550
Is that good though?

3080
03:09:51,510 --> 03:09:52,550
I feel like, hmm.

3081
03:09:54,030 --> 03:09:54,790
Maybe it is.

3082
03:09:55,290 --> 03:09:55,870
I'll take it.

3083
03:09:57,430 --> 03:09:59,430
I think it's nice to have as an alternative, maybe.

3084
03:10:00,450 --> 03:10:04,150
You know, you have your normal damage wand, and then you have the rock wand.

3085
03:10:05,290 --> 03:10:07,810
If the situation calls for it, you bring out Dwayne Johnson.

3086
03:10:09,470 --> 03:10:11,750
And shit pops off, you know?

3087
03:10:16,890 --> 03:10:18,150
Green glimmer, no thanks.

3088
03:10:20,410 --> 03:10:23,310
Look at all the... This is truly the place to get wands.

3089
03:10:24,350 --> 03:10:28,610
Like, I thought maybe I got lucky before finding all those, but this is consistently a lot of wands.

3090
03:10:29,030 --> 03:10:29,430
What's that?

3091
03:10:31,150 --> 03:10:31,570
Plasma beam thrower.

3092
03:10:34,670 --> 03:10:36,310
That's a bit too wild for me, I think.

3093
03:10:47,920 --> 03:10:48,840
Get off of me.

3094
03:10:55,090 --> 03:10:55,690
Hahaha.

3095
03:10:57,890 --> 03:11:03,050
It's... Honestly, being able to fire black holes at any moment is the funniest shit ever.

3096
03:11:05,010 --> 03:11:06,490
It's such a power trip.

3097
03:11:07,930 --> 03:11:11,210
Such a nice fantasy I've had forever, you know?

3098
03:11:11,470 --> 03:11:11,930
What's that?

3099
03:11:12,730 --> 03:11:13,230
Knockback.

3100
03:11:15,230 --> 03:11:15,670
Cool.

3101
03:11:16,170 --> 03:11:17,390
I think I may have found that before.

3102
03:11:30,010 --> 03:11:30,310
Damn.

3103
03:11:40,410 --> 03:11:40,970
Okay.

3104
03:11:47,430 --> 03:11:47,930
Firebolts.

3105
03:11:48,590 --> 03:11:49,090
Hahaha.

3106
03:11:56,960 --> 03:11:57,260
Damn.

3107
03:11:59,080 --> 03:11:59,820
There it is.

3108
03:12:01,180 --> 03:12:02,120
Bunch of black holes.

3109
03:12:03,680 --> 03:12:04,880
Not that I need them now anymore.

3110
03:12:09,450 --> 03:12:10,370
Good wand though.

3111
03:12:21,760 --> 03:12:23,020
Oh, I've checked these already.

3112
03:12:23,760 --> 03:12:24,460
Let's go further down.

3113
03:12:32,490 --> 03:12:32,890
Okay.

3114
03:12:34,430 --> 03:12:36,610
Let's see how far down we can go here.

3115
03:12:37,950 --> 03:12:38,870
It's gonna be the new chest.

3116
03:12:39,650 --> 03:12:41,010
Whoa, what a chain reaction.

3117
03:12:51,790 --> 03:12:52,890
Wait, now I'm getting high?

3118
03:12:55,610 --> 03:12:55,870
Huh?

3119
03:12:58,290 --> 03:12:59,350
Whoa, it's like...

3120
03:12:59,350 --> 03:13:00,730
That's a delayed reaction, man.

3121
03:13:00,770 --> 03:13:02,990
That's like taking edibles, you know?

3122
03:13:03,270 --> 03:13:04,670
You're like, oh, I don't feel anything.

3123
03:13:05,970 --> 03:13:07,950
And then like half an hour later, you're like...

3124
03:13:11,070 --> 03:13:12,690
That's pretty much what this is.

3125
03:13:13,530 --> 03:13:14,870
Oh, I'm high as fuck now.

3126
03:13:15,010 --> 03:13:15,990
It's kicking in, boys.

3127
03:13:19,110 --> 03:13:20,070
We're tripping.

3128
03:13:22,730 --> 03:13:23,690
Holy shit.

3129
03:13:24,190 --> 03:13:26,030
Even looks like my projectiles are bending.

3130
03:13:26,450 --> 03:13:28,630
Oh, but I guess they are because of the black hole.

3131
03:13:31,570 --> 03:13:33,190
Oh, that's funny as hell.

3132
03:13:35,230 --> 03:13:39,650
Imagine the start of Noita when you spawn in and then compare this to this right here.

3133
03:13:40,530 --> 03:13:41,750
It's not even the same game.

3134
03:13:43,330 --> 03:13:44,770
The rules have changed now.

3135
03:13:49,740 --> 03:13:51,500
This is not Noita, this is Noi 2.

3136
03:13:53,760 --> 03:13:55,760
I'm at a solid Noi...

3137
03:13:55,760 --> 03:13:57,520
Noi 9 out of Noi 10.

3138
03:14:00,120 --> 03:14:01,500
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa.

3139
03:14:02,320 --> 03:14:02,980
What is all that?

3140
03:14:04,740 --> 03:14:06,940
In vesibilium, acid, all kinds of bullshit.

3141
03:14:07,800 --> 03:14:08,040
Whoa.

3142
03:14:10,240 --> 03:14:12,820
Holy shit, I'm high as fuck.

3143
03:14:14,140 --> 03:14:16,660
Dude, the black hole even absorbs the liquids.

3144
03:14:18,320 --> 03:14:19,420
It's incredible.

3145
03:14:20,040 --> 03:14:22,500
The black hole is not just for digging, it's for...

3146
03:14:23,620 --> 03:14:24,260
I don't even know.

3147
03:14:25,780 --> 03:14:27,260
Just getting rid of shit.

3148
03:14:28,740 --> 03:14:29,380
It's fantastic.

3149
03:14:29,740 --> 03:14:30,560
This guy's bleeding a lot.

3150
03:14:35,530 --> 03:14:35,630
Wait!

3151
03:14:36,550 --> 03:14:36,830
Polymorphine!

3152
03:14:37,230 --> 03:14:37,510
We're leaving!

3153
03:14:38,650 --> 03:14:39,710
Oh no, oh no.

3154
03:14:40,370 --> 03:14:41,970
I just got sober real quick.

3155
03:14:43,350 --> 03:14:43,650
Nope.

3156
03:14:47,940 --> 03:14:50,140
Oh, but wait, no, it's hitting me again now.

3157
03:14:51,160 --> 03:14:51,660
Oh yeah.

3158
03:14:53,460 --> 03:14:56,140
What are all these little things jumping on me?

3159
03:14:58,120 --> 03:15:00,060
Oh, I don't care, I can't die.

3160
03:15:03,360 --> 03:15:05,020
Holy shit, what's up, dude?

3161
03:15:06,740 --> 03:15:07,420
How you doing?

3162
03:15:07,540 --> 03:15:09,300
There's too many of these small frogs.

3163
03:15:15,150 --> 03:15:16,010
We got a wand.

3164
03:15:17,390 --> 03:15:17,970
Is that water?

3165
03:15:18,250 --> 03:15:18,550
It is.

3166
03:15:22,010 --> 03:15:25,690
Oh man, my wand has been severely upgraded with that chainsaw.

3167
03:15:26,270 --> 03:15:28,590
And what a simple combination it is as well.

3168
03:15:31,750 --> 03:15:32,910
That seems dangerous.

3169
03:15:34,050 --> 03:15:35,390
But not for me, because I'm immune.

3170
03:15:38,980 --> 03:15:40,720
Ooh, we jumped right into my face.

3171
03:15:43,620 --> 03:15:44,340
What was that?

3172
03:15:45,380 --> 03:15:45,840
Pheromone, I think.

3173
03:15:49,640 --> 03:15:50,540
Let's get high again.

3174
03:15:52,220 --> 03:15:53,120
We're not high enough.

3175
03:15:53,780 --> 03:15:54,620
I want to stay high.

3176
03:15:55,980 --> 03:15:58,220
You can't be in this place without being high.

3177
03:15:58,700 --> 03:15:59,460
That's the new rule.

3178
03:16:01,040 --> 03:16:02,660
This is the real experience.

3179
03:16:06,310 --> 03:16:07,770
Okay, I've checked on one already.

3180
03:16:08,270 --> 03:16:09,150
What is that up there?

3181
03:16:10,830 --> 03:16:11,190
Something.

3182
03:16:11,430 --> 03:16:13,170
I have a muscle spasm in my left...

3183
03:16:13,990 --> 03:16:14,550
hand.

3184
03:16:15,450 --> 03:16:15,770
Somehow.

3185
03:16:16,510 --> 03:16:17,190
It's weird.

3186
03:16:18,990 --> 03:16:21,770
Like, I can feel it vibrating, the muscle.

3187
03:16:23,910 --> 03:16:24,670
Feels odd.

3188
03:16:29,380 --> 03:16:30,220
Black holes for everyone.

3189
03:16:36,530 --> 03:16:37,410
Oh, I'm scared.

3190
03:16:40,510 --> 03:16:41,090
What's that?

3191
03:16:42,610 --> 03:16:43,210
Leggy mutation.

3192
03:16:44,970 --> 03:16:46,410
No, I don't...

3193
03:16:46,410 --> 03:16:47,190
That's a perk.

3194
03:16:48,090 --> 03:16:49,110
Also, what is that down there?

3195
03:16:50,730 --> 03:16:51,450
That's polymorphine.

3196
03:16:52,130 --> 03:16:52,650
No, thanks.

3197
03:16:54,950 --> 03:16:56,270
Nope, I don't want none of that.

3198
03:16:57,070 --> 03:17:00,250
In fact, let's not get high anymore, because I have trouble distinguishing liquids.

3199
03:17:01,790 --> 03:17:02,210
But here's the thing.

3200
03:17:02,510 --> 03:17:03,750
Black hole will absorb that, right?

3201
03:17:03,850 --> 03:17:05,330
This is the safe way to dispose of it.

3202
03:17:05,330 --> 03:17:06,250
Just throw into a black hole.

3203
03:17:08,770 --> 03:17:09,710
Sort of.

3204
03:17:14,860 --> 03:17:15,320
Oh my god.

3205
03:17:16,180 --> 03:17:16,920
Way too many enemies.

3206
03:17:22,580 --> 03:17:23,760
Let's just find some ones!

3207
03:17:31,980 --> 03:17:32,720
What's this?

3208
03:17:33,800 --> 03:17:35,060
Giant spitter bolt, reduce lifetime.

3209
03:17:37,220 --> 03:17:37,460
Oh.

3210
03:17:38,780 --> 03:17:39,980
Reduces castile as well.

3211
03:17:42,000 --> 03:17:42,700
That's kind of nice.

3212
03:17:43,960 --> 03:17:44,880
With a lot, actually.

3213
03:17:45,860 --> 03:17:45,920
Ooh.

3214
03:17:47,140 --> 03:17:48,180
Very neat.

3215
03:17:54,420 --> 03:17:54,940
But...

3216
03:17:54,940 --> 03:17:56,360
I don't want to replace my current.

3217
03:17:56,560 --> 03:17:57,100
Actually, I do.

3218
03:17:58,200 --> 03:17:58,600
Do I?

3219
03:17:58,760 --> 03:17:58,920
No.

3220
03:17:59,720 --> 03:17:59,820
No.

3221
03:18:00,600 --> 03:18:01,540
I'll keep what I have.

3222
03:18:02,800 --> 03:18:03,940
We got another wand up there.

3223
03:18:11,150 --> 03:18:12,170
Let's keep healing.

3224
03:18:13,930 --> 03:18:14,190
Damn.

3225
03:18:15,830 --> 03:18:16,810
Homing plasma beam crosses.

3226
03:18:20,670 --> 03:18:21,550
Look at this one.

3227
03:18:23,450 --> 03:18:24,490
Very luminous.

3228
03:18:25,170 --> 03:18:25,870
Shiny like chrome.

3229
03:18:30,100 --> 03:18:31,520
I don't even need gold anymore.

3230
03:18:32,860 --> 03:18:34,100
I can't get any more perks.

3231
03:18:34,960 --> 03:18:36,380
And I can't buy anything anymore.

3232
03:18:36,500 --> 03:18:37,760
Unless I find a shop, I guess.

3233
03:18:39,320 --> 03:18:40,500
Which I guess is possible.

3234
03:18:41,460 --> 03:18:42,100
There could be shops.

3235
03:18:42,620 --> 03:18:42,920
Who knows?

3236
03:18:50,470 --> 03:18:50,770
Alright.

3237
03:18:53,050 --> 03:18:54,530
Oh, I have a twitchy...

3238
03:18:54,530 --> 03:18:55,550
No wait, why would I...

3239
03:18:55,550 --> 03:18:56,430
Was I drunk just now?

3240
03:18:58,350 --> 03:18:59,650
Maybe I had whiskey in my system.

3241
03:19:05,380 --> 03:19:06,100
Recall damper...

3242
03:19:06,100 --> 03:19:06,480
No.

3243
03:19:07,480 --> 03:19:08,720
None of that for me, please.

3244
03:19:11,960 --> 03:19:13,480
I'm not even carrying water anymore.

3245
03:19:13,580 --> 03:19:15,820
That's how crazy this whole thing has become.

3246
03:19:19,570 --> 03:19:20,450
That's ambrosia.

3247
03:19:28,150 --> 03:19:29,510
I checked that one already, I think.

3248
03:19:31,010 --> 03:19:31,190
Yep.

3249
03:19:31,910 --> 03:19:32,730
Let's keep going down.

3250
03:19:36,870 --> 03:19:38,270
Oh yeah, look at all these wands.

3251
03:19:38,430 --> 03:19:39,010
They're everywhere.

3252
03:19:43,830 --> 03:19:44,130
Hey!

3253
03:19:45,490 --> 03:19:46,490
Don't mind if I do!

3254
03:19:47,890 --> 03:19:51,570
An extra one of those can have like insane effects.

3255
03:19:52,310 --> 03:19:58,050
Because it stacks like multiplicatively, I guess, when you add them together like that.

3256
03:19:59,650 --> 03:20:01,870
Well, it's just adding, I guess, in that case.

3257
03:20:02,130 --> 03:20:07,370
But the fact that it's shooting so fast makes it do so much more damage, right?

3258
03:20:08,590 --> 03:20:09,610
Or double the amount, I guess.

3259
03:20:10,110 --> 03:20:10,990
Basically double the damage.

3260
03:20:12,150 --> 03:20:12,830
Never mind what I said.

3261
03:20:15,150 --> 03:20:15,510
What's that?

3262
03:20:16,170 --> 03:20:16,410
Anti-homing?

3263
03:20:16,630 --> 03:20:17,190
That seems bad.

3264
03:20:27,500 --> 03:20:27,660
Ow!

3265
03:20:29,380 --> 03:20:32,420
Kind of want to just go right, I can easily dig now.

3266
03:20:33,940 --> 03:20:35,060
But wait, no, no, no, we need teleport.

3267
03:20:38,430 --> 03:20:40,950
We need teleport to solve the mysteries of this game.

3268
03:20:49,170 --> 03:20:49,910
Water to poison?

3269
03:20:50,810 --> 03:20:51,830
Yeah, how about no?

3270
03:20:53,230 --> 03:20:54,490
How about poison to water?

3271
03:20:56,010 --> 03:20:56,890
How about them apples?

3272
03:20:58,630 --> 03:21:00,130
That's something I would immensely enjoy.

3273
03:21:02,530 --> 03:21:03,410
We did it!

3274
03:21:04,330 --> 03:21:05,110
We did it!

3275
03:21:06,430 --> 03:21:07,330
Fuck yeah!

3276
03:21:08,970 --> 03:21:09,970
There we go!

3277
03:21:11,050 --> 03:21:11,970
And it's already primed!

3278
03:21:12,490 --> 03:21:14,750
